Z||000005||CozmoPooky||02-16-2001||09:36 AM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> Must have been "Bad Juju" that night, Lisa!<BR>My Duke killed it's battery at that meeting, I put a new one in yesterday and now my dash lights are kaput (how is that related?).<BR>Oh well...<BR>If you want some help on your Fiero I'm sure some of the club members will pitch in (myself included), let me know.<BR>For anyone interested that lives in the Tampa Bay area, the Suncoast Fiero club is first rate!<BR>Contact Dave Connelly, Pres. at 813-855-4556 or Jim Cleary, V.P. at 727-345-1934 for membership info.<BR>Wait till y'all see what we do at Daytona!<BR>  <P><P>------------------<BR>Cozmo<BR>Suncoast Fieros<BR>'87 Duke Coupe     <BR>'85 2M6 Targa<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/bothfierossig1.jpg"> ||||reg||9
